{
"Items.SpecterRing.Desc": "An enchanted plain-looking silver ring. It boosts the wearer's agility and critical precision, at the cost of reducing their health. It's likely that whoever crafted this wished to remain inconspicuous, and perhaps went too far in pursuing this end. "
"Items.SpecterRing.Long": "a plain silver ring"
"Items.SpecterRing.Short": "Specter Ring"
